## Alternative Public API Version

If you prefer API-based ingestion instead of file drops:

Replace sales_transactions.csv with a fetch from:
- **Fake Store API**: https://fakestoreapi.com/products (free, no auth)
  - Returns JSON with: id, title, price, category, rating
  - Can simulate "product data ingestion"

Pipeline becomes:
- Step 0: api_fetch (get products from Fake Store API)
- Step 1: vlookup (join with internal catalog on product_name)
- Step 2: groupby (summarize by category)

This tests: API atom + vlookup + groupby in one composite pipeline.
env_file not needed (public API, no auth).

Manifest trigger: schedule with cron "0 8 * * 1" (every Monday 8 AM).
